{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46086","headline":"蜀王登福感寺塔三首 二 · 贯休","name":"蜀王登福感寺塔三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"似圣悲增道不穷，忧民忧国契尧聪。\n两髯有雪丹霄外，万里无尘一望中。\n南照微明连莽苍，峨嵋拥秀接崆峒。\n林僧岁月知何幸，还似支公见谢公。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46086.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46086","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}